window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-f6981a478156","messages":[{"id":"RP-0202272","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"... 졸리고 피곤하구나\n\n하지만 돈을 벌어야한다. 신나게 단검을 던져댄 탓에 돈이 부족하다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202273","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!의지","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202274","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 의지 판정 :\n[3] + [-1] = [2]\n결과 : 비극, 이 또한 당신의 운명입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202275","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"몰라 그냥 잘랭...","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202276","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이모티콘","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202277","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202278","time":"2026-07-30T01:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"... to be continue.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202358","time":"2026-07-30T23:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...\n이제 진짜 돈을 벌어야한다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202359","time":"2026-07-30T23:33:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!의지+4","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202360","time":"2026-07-30T23:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 의지 판정 :\n[5] + [-1] + [4] = [8]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202361","time":"2026-07-30T23:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그그걱걹\"\n기지개와 함께 침대에서 일어나 아래층으로 내려간다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202362","time":"2026-07-30T23:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"오늘따라 하찮은 의뢰들이 많이 보인다.\n\"어디 만만한 거... 없나...\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202363","time":"2026-07-30T23:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"고양이 찾기...이거나 해볼까.\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202364","time":"2026-07-30T23:39:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"흐흠... 뭐, 마땅한 게 없네. 이거나 해야겠다. 그리고 앞으로는... 단검 좀 아껴야지.\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202365","time":"2026-07-30T23:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"신나게 뚜벅뚜벅...\n\n...\n\n의뢰주에게 고양이의 외형을 전달받는다.\n\"눈처럼 하얗고... 보석처럼 파란 눈... 예, 찾아보죠.\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202366","time":"2026-07-30T23:41:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"근처는 주택이 많으니, 주택 사이와... 나무 위...를 둘러보니...","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202367","time":"2026-07-30T23:42:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"저 꼬질꼬질한건가. 대충 흰 색이고 눈은.. 파랗네.\"\n나무 위에서 애옹거리는 것이 보인다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202368","time":"2026-07-30T23:42:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"야옹아, 내려오지 않으련~?\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202369","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!매력","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202370","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 매력 판정 :\n[6] + [0] = [6]\n결과 : 쓰라린 실패, 운명을 빗겨갈 순 없습니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202371","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"{하아아아앍}","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202372","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"한 숨을 쉬며 나무를 타 손을 뻗는다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202373","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!민첩","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202374","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 민첩 판정 :\n[6] + [2] = [8]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202375","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!체력","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202376","time":"2026-07-30T23:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'세드릭'의 체력 판정 :\n[10] + [0] = [10]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202377","time":"2026-07-30T23:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사소한 저항이 있었으나 능숙한 손놀림으로 겁에 질린 털뭉치를 품에 안는 것에 성공했다. 그대로 데려가니...","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202378","time":"2026-07-30T23:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!운명","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202379","time":"2026-07-30T23:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"운명 : 4 = 4\n결과 : 쓰라린 실패, 운명을 빗겨갈 순 없습니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-0202380","time":"2026-07-30T23:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"엥? 얘가 아니라구요? 에? 이미 찾았어요?\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202381","time":"2026-07-30T23:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"집안에는 이 털뭉치보다 훨씬 고급지게 하얀 털과 파란 눈을 가진 고양이가 거만하게 누워있다.\n\"아니... 그... 뭐, 잘 됐네요. 예.\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202382","time":"2026-07-30T23:47:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"터덜터덜...\n[에에옹]\n\"... 얘는 그럼 어쩌지.\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202383","time":"2026-07-30T23:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"... 우선 내 방에 둬야겠다. 아서 씨가 고양이 알레르기가 없길 바래야지.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202384","time":"2026-07-30T23:49:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"니 이름은 인쟈 복실이여.\"\n\n돈은커녕 돈 샐 구멍만 하나 더 는 채, 오늘의 해도 저물어간다.","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202385","time":"2026-07-30T23:50:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"돈은 내일 벌어야지. 에휴...\"","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202386","time":"2026-07-30T23:50:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"세드릭","profile":"세드릭","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-4b8d7bf3c420"]},{"id":"RP-0202387","time":"2026-07-30T23:50:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"...다음 시간에.","characters":[]}]};
